,"x":33.40125347222522,"y":325.7580899902076,"rot":1.1,"w":220,"img":"./uploads/cc170e79-4614-4865-bc4d-0d929b4bfa24.png","caption":"","color":"#8c9b74","z":207,"frame":"none","shadow":false,"tape":false},{"id":"note-1785920137852","type":"note","x":9.708335376583047,"y":391.99587477756074,"rot":-1.5,"w":200,"text":"<font face=\"Caveat, cursive\">I never really understood what hospitality truly meant until I joined Monash clubs. Taking care of people, having fun, an atmosphere for people share interest with you. That part I realized is a key integral part of who I am now. I will miss every moment of it.</font><div><font face=\"Caveat, cursive\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Caveat, cursive\">My cooking was not a means for me to flex my skills, it was my way to show love back. All I can hope is that people can receive it with the same amount passion as we will have creating it. This was never meant to make a club the best, but this is going to make everyone that joins MEGA or SAMA enjoy their time here, and at the end of the day, that's worth it.</font></div>","color":"#8c9b74","z":208,"richText":true,"noteStyle":"sticky","noteColor":"#90caf9"}],"canvasBg":"#dce8dc","canvasBgImage":"./uploads/123d58be-38d6-4195-846f-84ed0a173b8a.jpg"}